    "result_text": "All 269 tests pass, including the new `Cp06Tests`.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `displayName` field on the owner response, formatted as `LastName, FirstName`.\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `displayName` string property to the `Owner` schema so the generated `OwnerDto` includes the field (and it's documented in the API contract).\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct `@Mapping` on `toOwnerDto` that computes the field via expression:\n   ```java\n   @Mapping(target = \"displayName\", expression = \"java(owner.getLastName() + \\\", \\\" + owner.getFirstName())\")\n   OwnerDto toOwnerDto(Owner owner);\n   ```\n\nBecause both the create (`addOwner`) and read (`getOwner`) paths map through `toOwnerDto`, the computed `displayName` is returned consistently. It's a derived field with no persistence needed. The full suite (269 tests) is green.",
